# Keep every checkout byte-identical on Windows and macOS/Linux.
# The extension parses prompts/*.md with regular expressions that used to break
# when Git rewrote LF to CRLF on a Windows checkout, so text files are pinned to
# LF no matter what core.autocrlf says on the machine doing the clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never let Git touch binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
